/-!
# The ball chain of the torus-A QA-defect (N-34, D4)

The balls `‖X i − x i‖₀ ≤ E i` (strip `ρ = 0`, i.e. `ℓ¹` norms of the Fourier coefficients) of all
variables of the QA-defect chain of Dommaschk torus A at the surrogate torus (`XQ`,
`Design/DommaschkKamAQSDefRel`): the Adm balls (`ballA_all`, strip `0.045`) restricted to `ρ = 0`,
then variable by variable (`ballQ_k`, `chain_succ`) from the kernel checks of
`Design/DommaschkKamAQSDefCheck*` with unit weights (`node_fullw`, `center_fullw` with `P = 1`,
`E = 0`) and the node identities `relQ_*`; and the norm nodes `nQ_*`. Generated by
`scripts/dommaschk_kam/emit_qsdef.py`.
-/

@[expose] public section
noncomputable section

namespace PlasmaLean.Design.DommaschkKamA

open PlasmaLean.Design.DommaschkKamC

